    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3868" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλᾰπ-αδνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαπάζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily
				exhausted</i>, i.e. <i>powerless, feeble</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στίχες, σθένος, μῦθος</span>, etc., <i><span class="en">
