			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαπαδνότεροι γὰρ ἔσεσθε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.305
				</span></i>
			. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ-</span> euph., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαπαδνός</span>.)</div>
